/ The data column of a receipt page, read-only: OCR state, the stored fields, the QR comparison and the items.
/ Shown while the receipt may not be edited (not read yet, OCR queued or running, OCR failed); the review
/ form (receipts/_review) takes its place otherwise. The page's live refresh (Receipts::LiveUpdate) morphs
/ it when OCR starts, finishes or fails.
section.min-w-0.space-y-8 id=dom_id(receipt, :data) aria-label="Receipt data"
  = render "receipts/ocr_state", receipt: receipt
  = render "receipts/details", receipt: receipt
  = render "receipts/qr_comparison", receipt: receipt
  = render "receipts/items", receipt: receipt
